meta {
  name: 2. Get By Role Name
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{local}}/admin/role-apis/getByRoleName
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  user-username: {{username}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "roleName": "SUPERVISOR"
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  ## Get Endpoints by Role Name (QA Inspection)
  
  Endpoint ini untuk QA melihat detail semua endpoint yang dikonfigurasi untuk role tertentu.
  
  ### Request Body:
  - `roleName`: (required) Code role yang mau dicek (SUPERVISOR, MANAGER, OPERATOR, dll)
  
  ### Response Fields:
  - `id`: ID mapping
  - `roleName`: Role name
  - `serviceName`: Service yang handle endpoint (master-data, inventory, smart-access)
  - `httpMethod`: HTTP method (POST, GET, dll)
  - `httpEndpoint`: Full endpoint path
  - `description`: Deskripsi fungsi endpoint
  - `isActive`: true = aktif, false = non-aktif
  
  ### Use Case:
  - QA check endpoint mana saja yang accessible oleh role tertentu
  - Validasi apakah endpoint yang di-test sudah dikonfigurasi
  - Compare dengan requirement: role SUPERVISOR harusnya bisa akses endpoint X, Y, Z
  
  ### Expected Result (jika sudah dikonfigurasi):
  ```json
  {
    "httpCode": 200,
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "019abcde-1234-5678-9abc-def012345678",
        "roleName": "SUPERVISOR",
        "serviceName": "master-data",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "httpEndpoint": "/api/v1/master-data/business-parties/getAll",
        "description": "View all business parties",
        "isActive": true,
        "createdBy": "admin",
        "createdAt": "2026-08-15T10:30:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "019abcde-1234-5678-9abc-def012345679",
        "roleName": "SUPERVISOR",
        "serviceName": "master-data",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "httpEndpoint": "/api/v1/master-data/business-parties/save",
        "description": "Create business party",
        "isActive": true,
        "createdBy": "admin",
        "createdAt": "2026-08-15T10:30:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ### Expected Result (jika belum dikonfigurasi):
  ```json
  {
    "httpCode": 200,
    "data": []
  }
  ```
  
  **Jika data kosong** → Test harus SKIP dengan reason "Role-to-endpoint mapping not configured"
}
